pps/3604870/extras/3d654416e5b793219a99505888a245a8.poster.avif?t=1755472187\" width=800 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604870/extras/3d654416e5b793219a99505888a245a8.webm?t=1755472187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604870/extras/3d654416e5b793219a99505888a245a8.mp4?t=1755472187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604870/extras/05d35d276ebc7f0c83a210de50fa447a.poster.avif?t=1755472187\" width=800 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604870/extras/05d35d276ebc7f0c83a210de50fa447a.webm?t=1755472187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604870/extras/05d35d276ebc7f0c83a210de50fa447a.mp4?t=1755472187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock game-changing abilies and try to survive. <br> <br>Prepare for a new era of cyber warfare. Wishlist Cyber Sentinel! today and dominate the digital frontier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Default Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Sentinel supports both Keyboard/Mouse and Gamepad input.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard Controls <br>Core Movement:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W / Up Arrow: Move Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S / Down Arrow: Move Down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A / Left Arrow: Move Left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D / Right Arrow: Move Right</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space: Fire Weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-0: Switch Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: System Overload Ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F: EMP Blast Ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Digital Shield Ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: Network Distortion Ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Nano Swarm Ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V: Virus Injection Ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menus &amp; Utilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B: Toggle Upgrade Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P: Pause / Unpause Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab: Switch Music Track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M: Toggle Music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: Close Current Menu / Back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys: Navigate Menu Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter: Confirm Selection</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Menu Specific:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 / 2 / 3: Select Upgrade Option 1 / 2 / 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space / Enter: Confirm Selection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R: Reroll Upgrades (if available)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys: Navigate Between Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Screens:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Over: A Button (Retry), B Button (Exit), Y Button (Stats)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language Select: D-Pad/Left Stick (Navigate), A Button (Confirm), B Button (Close) </p>",
